#pragma version 10
// KNOWN FALSE POSITIVE (recorded deliberately — see tests/benchmark/README.md).
// The sender guard is real and dominates the sink, but its RESULT is round-
// tripped through scratch before the assert. The lift keeps `store`/`load` as
// IR intrinsics and rebuilds from the op stream rather than the SSA def-use
// graph, so fund_flow's def-walk dead-ends at `(load 0)` and never reaches the
// `==`. Fixing it needs a scratch reaching-def over the IR, gated on block
// dominance, threaded through _walk's call sites.
txn Sender
global CreatorAddress
==
store 0
load 0
assert
itxn_begin
int pay
itxn_field TypeEnum
txna ApplicationArgs 0
itxn_field Receiver
int 1000
itxn_field Amount
itxn_submit
int 1
return
